	(text "EXCITATION BUS +/-2.048 V: REF5020; ONE HALF OF AN OPA2189 FOLLOWS IT,\nTHE OTHER INVERTS IT, EACH DRIVING ONE SIDE OF THE BUS DIRECTLY.\n+/-65 mA OUTPUT LIMIT BOUNDS A SHORT ON THE BUS. INVERTER PAIR 0.05%, 5 ppm/C.\nBUS STABILITY WITH THE REFERENCE CAPACITORS TO BE CONFIRMED (TBD)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 149.86 111.76 0)
