	)
	(text "SENSOR CURRENT = 10 uA x 30.1k / R(OUT TO EXC+); THE LT3092 HOLDS 0.3 V ACROSS IT.\nS1 AND S2: P-CHANNEL, SOURCE TOWARD THE LT3092; A BSS138W PULLS THE GATE TOWARD -5 V\nTHROUGH 10k AGAINST 100k; 16 V ZENER GATE TO SOURCE (EXC+ REACHES 24 V)"
